OL,3,GNEWSAFormer police officer who raped
OL,4,Asleeping woman jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police officer who filmed
OL,7,Fhimself raping a sleeping woman has
OL,8,Fbeen jailed for seven years.
OL,10,FDerek McNee preyed on his victim at a
OL,11,Fhouse in East Dunbartonshire in 2025.
OL,13,FThe 43 year-old was caught after police
OL,14,Ffound four incriminating videos which
OL,15,Fhe had captured on his mobile phone.
OL,17,FMcNee was sentenced at the High Court
OL,18,Fin Glasgow after previously admitting a
OL,19,Fcharge of rape.
